      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e ```\n\u003e salt \u003d if (llpvm_changes) {salt_from_instance_id(fdt)?} else {entry.salt}\n\u003e ```\n\nIf a salt has been recorded, shouldn\u0027t we always use it in this \"legacy\" mode?\n\nIn particular as we\u0027re telling the guest that `new_instance\u003dfalse`?\n\nOtherwise, this would act as a backdoor for the host to inject its own salt, right?",
